// The PE entry point of a SultanC executable: the process start the LLVM
// provider emits (backend/provider/llvm/entry.sn), which calls the language
// entry and exits through kernel32's ExitProcess. It is the same spelling as
// the ELF and WASI process starts. Previously the image entered through the
// C runtime's mainCRTStartup/wmainCRTStartup, which called main or wmain.
عام عرف اسم_رمز_بدء_عملية_كوف(): متجه غ8 {
    دع الاسم: متجه غ8 = بايتات_من_نص(«_start»);
    أرجع الاسم;
}
